sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User/CMP-001
  participant C as CMP-002 Capability
  participant O as CMP-003 Observer
  participant E as CMP-004 Estimator
  participant P as CMP-005 Policy
  participant S as CMP-008 Store
  U->>C: start diagnose / refresh profile
  C-->>U: DeviceProfile + UNKNOWNs
  U->>O: start bounded session
  O->>S: samples / incident window
  O->>E: evidence bundle
  E-->>P: StateEstimate + confidence
  P-->>U: NO_OP / capture / guidance / shadow candidate
  P->>S: decision provenance
  Note over U,P: Initial builds do not execute privileged writes
